abstract: "Code for the paper Feature-Block Portability and Operating-Point Drift in DART-Spread Spike Prediction, by Erce Erez: the price-only pipeline (downloaders of the public day-ahead and real-time prices of NYISO, ISO-NE, MISO and CAISO, the development analyses) and the machinery and the protocol of the two pre-specified forward tests, of which the first has been run."
